<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lab Session Expiring Soon</title>
    <!--[if mso]>
    <noscript>
        <xml>
            <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
                <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
            </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
        </xml>
    </noscript>
    <![endif]-->
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #f8f9fa;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 20px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: white; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                    <!-- Header -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color: #f59e0b; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; position: relative;">
                            <h1 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: white;">
                                ⚠️ Lab Session Expiring Soon
                            </h1>
                            <p style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0; color: white; opacity: 0.9;">
                                Save your progress and complete your work
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Main Content -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 40px 30px 0 30px;">
                            <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                Hello {{userName}},
                            </div>
                            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 25px 0;">
                                This is a friendly reminder that your lab session for <strong>{{labName}}</strong>
                                is scheduled to expire soon. Please make sure to save your work and complete any remaining tasks.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Warning Info Card -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 0 30px;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 25px;">
                                        <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                            ⏰ Expiration Details
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- Expiration Details Grid -->
                                        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%;">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="width: 48%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 7px;">
                                                    <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                                        Expiration Time
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937;">
                                                        {{expirationTime}}
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="width: 48%; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px;">
                                                    <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                                        Time Remaining
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626;">
                                                        {{timeRemaining}}
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>

                                        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 15px;">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="width: 48%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 7px;">
                                                    <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                                        Session Started
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937;">
                                                        {{sessionStartTime}}
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="width: 48%; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px;">
                                                    <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                                        Auto-Save Status
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669;">
                                                        ✅ Enabled
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- CTA Section -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 auto;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color: #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px 30px;">
                                        <a href="{{accessUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">
                                            🚀 Continue Lab Session
                                        </a>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Action Items Section -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 0 30px 30px 30px;">
                            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
                                <strong>Action Items:</strong><br>
                                • Save any current work and notes<br>
                                • Complete any remaining lab exercises<br>
                                • Download any files you need to keep<br>
                                • Submit your lab if required<br>
                                • Consider extending your session if available
                            </p>

                            <!-- Important Notice -->
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 15px;">
                                        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                                            ⚠️ Important Notice
                                        </div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #7f1d1d;">
                                            After expiration, your lab environment will be terminated and all unsaved work will be lost.
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; margin: 20px 0 0 0;">
                                <strong>Need More Time?</strong> If you need to extend your session, please contact our support team
                                at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #f59e0b; text-decoration: none;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
                                as soon as possible.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 30px; background-color: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: center;">
                            <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                🚀 {{companyName}}
                            </div>
                            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 15px 0;">
                                Making the most of your hands-on learning experience.
                            </p>
                            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">
                                Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #f59e0b; text-decoration: none;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0;">
                                © {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
            right: -5px;
            background-color: #dc2626;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        .lab-name {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .time-remaining {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .countdown-timer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #b91c1c 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .countdown-number {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .countdown-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .action-buttons {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .primary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 36px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
        }
        .secondary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            border: 1px solid #3b82f6;
            color: #1e40af;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .checklist {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .checklist h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .checklist ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .checklist li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #4b5563;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .action-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .primary-button, .secondary-button {
                width: 100%;
                margin: 5px 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🚀 {{companyName}}</div>
            <h1 class="title">⏰ Lab Session Expiring Soon</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

            <p>This is an important reminder that your lab session is scheduled to expire soon. Please take immediate action to save your progress.</p>

            <div class="warning-banner">
                <div class="urgency-indicator">URGENT</div>
                <div class="lab-name">{{labName}}</div>
                {{#if expiresAt}}
                <div class="time-remaining">Expires: {{formatDate expiresAt}} at {{formatTime expiresAt}}</div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            {{#if timeRemaining}}
            <div class="countdown-timer">
                <div class="countdown-number">{{timeRemaining}}</div>
                <div class="countdown-label">Time Remaining</div>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div class="action-buttons">
                {{#if canExtend}}
                <a href="{{extendUrl}}" class="primary-button">⏰ Extend Session</a>
                {{/if}}
                <a href="{{accessUrl}}" class="secondary-button">🚀 Continue Lab</a>
            </div>

            <div class="warning-box">
                <strong>⚠️ What happens when your session expires?</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your lab environment will be automatically terminated</li>
                    <li>All unsaved work and progress will be lost</li>
                    <li>You'll need to restart the lab from the beginning</li>
                    <li>Any files or configurations not saved will be deleted</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="checklist">
                <h3>📋 Before Your Session Expires:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ Save all your work and important files</li>
                    <li>✅ Download any results or outputs you need</li>
                    <li>✅ Complete any remaining lab tasks</li>
                    <li>✅ Submit your lab if required</li>
                    {{#if canExtend}}
                    <li>✅ Consider extending your session if you need more time</li>
                    {{/if}}
                </ul>
            </div>

            {{#if canExtend}}
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>💡 Need More Time?</strong><br>
                You can extend your lab session {{#if maxExtensions}}up to {{maxExtensions}} times{{/if}} to give yourself more time to complete the exercises and save your work.
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <p>Don't let your hard work go to waste! Take action now to preserve your progress.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Need help extending your session? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
